Job experience: June 2016 y. – September 2018 y. Aldec-KTC
Activity field: development of the ALINT-PRO software, aimed at testing and verification of HDL designs.

Post: QA.
Functional responsibilities:
• Formation of specifications for future verification rules;
• Writing test-cases for further development of rules and other functions using the TDD method;
• Regression testing of the product;
• Manual and automatic verification of whole product;
• Filling the base of test-cases for the regression system;
• Describing of vendor component libraries;
• Developer consultation on the features of HDL languages and circuit design.

